    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DELIGHTFUL TWO BED COTTAGE FOR RENT WITH PLENTY OF OUTDOOR SPACE ONLY 5 MINUTES FROM BAILIEBOROUGH\n\n\nSmith Property bring to the rental market this Charming Two-bedroom Country Cottage Just 5 Minutes from Bailieborough.\n\n\nA character-filled country cottage offering peace, charm and traditional features, and conveniently located just a 5-minute drive from Bailieborough.\n\n\nThis delightful old cottage is full of character and retains many of its original features, including low ceilings, deep-set windows and a cosy traditional stove.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming sitting room with a multi-fuel stove, a fitted kitchen, bathroom and two comfortable bedrooms.\n\n\nSet in a peaceful countryside location, with plenty of outdoor space and use of the out houses, the property offers the perfect opportunity for those looking for a quieter way of life while remaining within easy reach of Bailieborough and its local amenities.\n\nTo Apply\n\n.\nInterested applicants are asked to visit the Smith Property website and complete the Tenancy Application Form, located in the Rental/Tenants section.\n\n\nPlease note that references are required before viewing. \nApplicants should have their current landlord reference and current work or character reference available for submission with the application.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "LIVING ROOM\nCeramic Tile Floor\nTimber Ceiling\nMulti fuel stove\n\nKITCHEN\nTile Floor\nAccess to back\n\nBATHROOM\nFully tiled\n\nBEDROOM 1\nLarge double bedroom\nWooden Floor\nWooden ceiling\n\nBEDROOM 2\nWooded Floor\nWooden Ceiling.\n\nNotice\nAll photographs are provided for guidance only."
